{"kind":{"type":"paragraph"},"runs":[{"text":"Every step the updater runs outside the process is bounded and is logged ","style":[],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":"before","style":["emphasis"],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":" it runs, never after: the probe carries a timeout and a kill, the build an idle clock, a wall-clock limit and a cancel, every kill signals the process group, the result type has a failure case that says it could not answer, and the log's last line is the step that stalled. Nothing may have only \"success\" and \"forever\" as outcomes (","style":[],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":"docs/solutions/runtime-errors/unbounded-preflight-probe-spins-with-no-step-log.md","style":["code"],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":").","style":[],"link":null,"image":false}],"quoteDepth":0,"listDepth":1,"marker":"bullet"},
{"kind":{"type":"paragraph"},"runs":[{"text":"One reader per ","style":[],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":"Pipe","style":["code"],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":". Setting a ","style":[],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":"readabilityHandler","style":["code"],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":" and also calling ","style":[],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":"readDataToEndOfFile()","style":["code"],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":" reads one descriptor from two places, and the second blocks until EOF — which a grandchild that inherited the write end never delivers, long after ","style":[],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":"terminationHandler","style":["code"],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":" has fired. Drain on a thread that stops at EOF, and bound that wait too.","style":[],"link":null,"image":false}],"quoteDepth":0,"listDepth":1,"marker":"bullet"},
{"kind":{"type":"paragraph"},"runs":[{"text":"Only ⌘W on a single tab drops it from the next launch. ","style":[],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":"OpenTabs.record","style":["code"],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":" merges the live tabs into the saved list and drops only its ","style":[],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":"dropping","style":["code"],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":" path; ⇧⌘W (","style":[],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":"keepingClosedTabs","style":["code"],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":") and ⌘Q relaunch with the same tabs. ","style":[],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":"OpenTabs.save","style":["code"],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":" replaces the list and only ","style":[],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":"restoreTabs","style":["code"],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":" calls it, to drop a repository that no longer opens.","style":[],"link":null,"image":false}],"quoteDepth":0,"listDepth":1,"marker":"bullet"},
